<h1 data-copy-en="Anthrax" data-copy-zh="Anthrax">Anthrax</h1>
<p class="starter-description" data-copy-en="Find Anthrax’s recruitment steps, Training Hall hours, combat lessons and army services." data-copy-zh="了解Anthrax的招募步骤、训练厅时段、战斗课程与军队服务。">Find Anthrax’s recruitment steps, Training Hall hours, combat lessons and army services.</p>
<div class="wiki-source-line"><span data-copy-en="v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026" data-copy-zh="v1.0_BETAx · 2026 年 11 月 9 日更新">v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026</span></div></div></section>
<section class="section wiki-reading-section"><div class="container wiki-reading-layout">
<aside class="wiki-toc"><div class="wiki-toc-inner"><button aria-expanded="false" class="wiki-toc-toggle" data-wiki-toc-toggle="" type="button"><span data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</span><span aria-hidden="true">+</span></button><p class="wiki-toc-heading" data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</p><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="en" data-wiki-toc-links=""><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-overview">Overview</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-location">Where to find them</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-route">Route and relationship milestones</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-activities">Activities and rewards</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-troubleshooting">What usually blocks the next step</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-related">Related guides</a></div><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="zh" data-wiki-toc-links="" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-overview">概览</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-location">去哪里找</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-route">路线与关系进展</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-activities">行动与奖励</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-troubleshooting">卡住时检查什么</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-related">相关指南</a></div></div></aside>
<article class="wiki-article"><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-en" data-lang-panel="en" lang="en"><section id="en-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="If_Progress_Stalls"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Optional_Dates"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="No_Lesson_Tonight"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Your_Turn"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="The_Woman_Behind_the_Name"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Heart-to-Heart_Choices"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Romance_Walkthrough"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="All_Automatic_Scenes"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Recruitment_and_Professional_Walkthrough"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Quick_Stats"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Overview"></span><h2>Overview</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="View full screenshot: Anthrax — character portrait." href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/anthrax.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Anthrax — character portrait." decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/anthrax.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Anthrax — character portrait.</figcaption></figure><p>Anthrax’s route opens after Story 74. It has twelve personal scenes, three H2Hs, two optional dates, combat lessons and army-training services. Her professional progression and later personal conversations use different stages and hours.</p></section>
<section id="en-location"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Unlock_and_Locations"></span><h2>Where to find them</h2><p>After Story 74, enter Operations Center at 08:00–21:59 for Unscheduled Instructor. Then find Anthrax at Underground Modification Clinic, 08:00–21:59 daily. Report for Training later begins at Operations Center and moves her regular portrait to Training Hall, still 08:00–21:59.</p><p>The location’s travel label is Training Hall. Daytime lessons and army services have narrower start windows than her portrait; her H2Hs start at 18:00–20:59.</p></section>
<section id="en-route"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Plot_Choice_Guide"></span><h2>Route and relationship milestones</h2><p>Follow the automatic scenes in order, returning to the listed room after each one. The daytime training scenes start before 18:00; the last two personal scenes start at 18:00–21:59. Complete the H2Hs from her Training Hall portrait as their requirements become available.</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Automatic scene</th><th scope="col">Location / start window</th><th scope="col">Requirements</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Unscheduled Instructor</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Operations Center; 08:00–21:59</td><td data-label="Requirements">Stranger (0); after Story 74</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Three Seconds</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Underground Modification Clinic; 08:00–21:59</td><td data-label="Requirements">Known (25); after Story 74 / Unscheduled Instructor</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Wrong Measure</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Underground Modification Clinic; 08:00–21:59</td><td data-label="Requirements">Acquaintance (50); after Story 74 / Three Seconds</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Report for Training</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Operations Center; 08:00–21:59</td><td data-label="Requirements">Friend (100); after Story 74 / The Wrong Measure</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Everyone Starts Somewhere</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Training Hall; 08:00–17:59</td><td data-label="Requirements">Friend (100); after Story 74 / Report for Training</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">A Different Answer</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Training Hall; 08:00–17:59</td><td data-label="Requirements">Friend (100); after Story 74 / Everyone Starts Somewhere</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Familiar Counter</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Training Hall; 08:00–17:59</td><td data-label="Requirements">Close Friend (200); after Story 74 / A Different Answer</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Dismissed</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Training Hall; 08:00–17:59</td><td data-label="Requirements">Close Friend (200); after Story 74 / The Familiar Counter</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Pass It On</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Training Hall; 08:00–17:59</td><td data-label="Requirements">Close Friend (200); after Story 74 / Dismissed</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Everyone Comes Back</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Training Hall; 08:00–17:59</td><td data-label="Requirements">Close Friend (200); after Story 74 / Pass It On</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">An Evening Without Instructions</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Training Hall; 18:00–21:59</td><td data-label="Requirements">Crush (400); after Story 74 / Everyone Comes Back</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Chosen Company</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Training Hall; 18:00–21:59</td><td data-label="Requirements">Romantic (800); after Story 74 / An Evening Without Instructions / No Lesson Tonight</td></tr></tbody></table><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Requirements / start window</th><th scope="col">Cost / recovery</th><th scope="col">Reward / limit</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">The Woman Behind the Name</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Friend (100); after Everyone Starts Somewhere; 18:00–20:59</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">60 min; 15 Energy</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Your Turn</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Close Friend (200); after A Different Answer / The Woman Behind the Name; 18:00–20:59</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">60 min; 15 Energy</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">No Lesson Tonight</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Crush (400); after An Evening Without Instructions / Your Turn; 18:00–20:59</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">60 min; 15 Energy</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">once</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Report for Training recruits her Army unit and opens her Training Hall schedule. Later affection and H2Hs advance her personal route separately. Chosen Company needs No Lesson Tonight as well as the previous automatic scene and Romantic (800).</p><p>Both dates are optional, one-time outings selected from her current portrait. They do not replace a required training scene or H2H.</p></section>
<section id="en-activities"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Training_and_Skills"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Actions"></span><h2>Activities and rewards</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Requirements / start window</th><th scope="col">Cost / recovery</th><th scope="col">Reward / limit</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Talk to Anthrax</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">during the portrait schedule</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">15 min</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">+1 base affection; 5/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Give Chocolate</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">during the portrait schedule</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">5 min; 1 Chocolate</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">+5 base affection; 2/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Off Target</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Friend (100); 18:00–19:59</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">120 min; $80; 25 Energy</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Nothing to Watch For</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Crush (400); 12:00–15:59</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">120 min; $80; 25 Energy</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Controlled Sparring</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">after Everyone Starts Somewhere; 08:00–16:59</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">60 min; 25 Energy</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">+2 base affection; Ability +1; 1/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Combat Reflexes</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Friend (100); Ability 15; after Everyone Starts Somewhere; 08:00–15:59</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">120 min; $250; 30 Energy</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">learn Combat Reflexes once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Weapon Mastery</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Close Friend (200); Ability 18; after Everyone Starts Somewhere; 08:00–14:59</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">180 min; $350; 40 Energy</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">learn Weapon Mastery once</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Advanced Footwork</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">after Everyone Comes Back; 08:00–16:59</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">60 min; 20 Energy</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">+8 base affection; Perception +1; once</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Talk gives 1 base affection, five times daily; Chocolate gives 5 base affection, twice daily. After Everyone Starts Somewhere, Controlled Sparring gives Ability +1 and 2 base affection once daily. After Everyone Comes Back, Advanced Footwork is a separate one-time claim for Perception +1 and 8 base affection; finishing the story does not claim it for you.</p><p>Training Efficiency and Recruit Training are Training Hall services, 08:00–17:59, after Report for Training and Everyone Starts Somewhere. Recruit Training exchanges 2 Army EXP for 1 personal recruit EXP. Training Efficiency is purchased separately for each recruited hero, up to level 10; it lowers stat-training EXP costs and refunds eligible previous spending. Use the Army guide for the material prices and full progression rules.</p><p>After Cid’s Chronium introduction, Strengthen Weapon is a one-time option at Training Hall. It consumes 10 Chronium ingots, takes no additional time and permanently raises your melee weapon level by 1. The resource is the smelted ingot, not raw ore.</p><p>Her favorite stats are Ability, Perception, Stamina. The learned Combat Reflexes skill improves her relationship bonus.</p><p>Start times are shown; the ending hour is excluded. Base affection receives the relationship bonuses, while direct affection is added as listed. H2Hs and automatic personal scenes complete once; ordinary affection, player Erotic Experience and NPC intimacy experience are separate.</p></section>
<section id="en-troubleshooting"><h2>What usually blocks the next step</h2><ul><li>No Anthrax portrait: complete Story 74 and trigger Unscheduled Instructor at Operations Center first.</li><li>She has left the clinic: after Report for Training, use Training Hall.</li><li>A daytime scene is missing in the evening: the middle training sequence starts before 18:00, whereas H2Hs start at 18:00.</li><li>No Lesson Tonight needs the earlier H2Hs and An Evening Without Instructions. Romantic alone will not open Chosen Company.</li><li>Advanced Footwork must be selected separately after Everyone Comes Back.</li><li>Strengthen Weapon needs Cid’s Chronium introduction and ten ingots, and cannot be bought repeatedly.</li></ul></section>
<section id="en-related"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Related_Pages"></span><h2>Related guides</h2><ul><li><a href="game-systems-relationships-dating-and-intimacy.html">Relationships — stages and bonuses</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-td-army.html">Army — recruit training and efficiency</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-tower-defense.html">Tower Defense — stronghold rooms</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-mining-system.html">Mining — ore and ingots</a></li><li><a href="character-cid.html">Cid — Chronium introduction</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-story-beats.html">Story progress</a></li></ul></section>
</div><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-zh" data-lang-panel="zh" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><section id="zh-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-If_Progress_Stalls"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Optional_Dates"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-No_Lesson_Tonight"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Your_Turn"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-The_Woman_Behind_the_Name"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Heart-to-Heart_Choices"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Romance_Walkthrough"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-All_Automatic_Scenes"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Recruitment_and_Professional_Walkthrough"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Quick_Stats"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Overview"></span><h2>概览</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="查看完整截图：Anthrax 的角色头像。" href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/anthrax.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Anthrax 的角色头像。" decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/anthrax.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Anthrax 的角色头像。</figcaption></figure><p>Anthrax的路线在完成主线74后开放，包含十二场个人事件、三次谈心、两场可选约会、战斗课程及军队训练服务。职业进展与后续个人关系使用不同的好感阶段和时段。</p></section>
<section id="zh-location"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Unlock_and_Locations"></span><h2>去哪里找</h2><p>完成主线74后，08:00–21:59进入作战中心触发“计划外的教官”，之后每天08:00–21:59可在地下改造诊所见到Anthrax。“报到任教”稍后也从作战中心开始，完成后固定头像改到训练厅，仍为08:00–21:59。</p><p>前往该房间的选项叫“训练厅”。日间课程与军队服务的开始时段比头像出没时间短；她的谈心则在18:00–20:59开始。</p></section>
<section id="zh-route"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Plot_Choice_Guide"></span><h2>路线与关系进展</h2><p>按顺序推进自动事件，每完成一项，再进入表列房间。中段日间训练事件要在18:00前开始，最后两场个人事件则为18:00–21:59。谈心条件满足后，从训练厅头像选择。</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">自动事件</th><th scope="col">地点／开始时段</th><th scope="col">条件</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">计划外的教官</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">作战中心; 08:00–21:59</td><td data-label="条件">陌生人（0）；完成：主线74</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">三秒</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">地下改造诊所; 08:00–21:59</td><td data-label="条件">已知（25）；完成：主线74、计划外的教官</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">错误的衡量标准</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">地下改造诊所; 08:00–21:59</td><td data-label="条件">相识（50）；完成：主线74、三秒</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">报到任教</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">作战中心; 08:00–21:59</td><td data-label="条件">朋友（100）；完成：主线74、错误的衡量标准</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">谁都有起点</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">训练厅; 08:00–17:59</td><td data-label="条件">朋友（100）；完成：主线74、报到任教</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">不同的答案</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">训练厅; 08:00–17:59</td><td data-label="条件">朋友（100）；完成：主线74、谁都有起点</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">熟悉的反制</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">训练厅; 08:00–17:59</td><td data-label="条件">亲密朋友（200）；完成：主线74、不同的答案</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">下课</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">训练厅; 08:00–17:59</td><td data-label="条件">亲密朋友（200）；完成：主线74、熟悉的反制</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">传下去</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">训练厅; 08:00–17:59</td><td data-label="条件">亲密朋友（200）；完成：主线74、下课</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">一个不少地回来</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">训练厅; 08:00–17:59</td><td data-label="条件">亲密朋友（200）；完成：主线74、传下去</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">没有指令的夜晚</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">训练厅; 18:00–21:59</td><td data-label="条件">迷恋（400）；完成：主线74、一个不少地回来</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">选择相伴</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">训练厅; 18:00–21:59</td><td data-label="条件">浪漫感（800）；完成：主线74、没有指令的夜晚、今晚不上课</td></tr></tbody></table><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">行动</th><th scope="col">条件／开始时段</th><th scope="col">消耗／恢复</th><th scope="col">奖励／次数</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">名字背后的她</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">朋友（100）；完成：谁都有起点；18:00–20:59</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">60分钟；15精力</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">仅一次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">轮到你了（菜单：你的回合）</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">亲密朋友（200）；完成：不同的答案、名字背后的她；18:00–20:59</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">60分钟；15精力</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">仅一次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">今晚不上课</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">迷恋（400）；完成：没有指令的夜晚、轮到你了；18:00–20:59</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">60分钟；15精力</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">仅一次</td></tr></tbody></table><p>“报到任教”会获得她的军队单位，并开放训练厅出没安排，之后好感与谈心另行推进个人路线。“选择相伴”除了前一自动事件和浪漫感（800），还要求完成“今晚不上课”。</p><p>两场约会都是从她当前头像开始的可选出游，各只能完成一次，不能代替前置训练事件或谈心。</p></section>
<section id="zh-activities"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Training_and_Skills"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Actions"></span><h2>行动与奖励</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">行动</th><th scope="col">条件／开始时段</th><th scope="col">消耗／恢复</th><th scope="col">奖励／次数</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">与Anthrax交谈</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">头像出现时</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">15分钟</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">基础好感+1；每天5次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">送巧克力</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">头像出现时</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">5分钟；巧克力×1</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">基础好感+5；每天2次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">偏离目标</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">朋友（100）；18:00–19:59</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">120分钟；$80；25精力</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">仅一次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">无事可戒备</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">迷恋（400）；12:00–15:59</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">120分钟；$80；25精力</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">仅一次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">控制性对练</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">完成：谁都有起点；08:00–16:59</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">60分钟；25精力</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">基础好感+2；能力 +1；每天1次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">战斗反射</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">朋友（100）；能力15；完成：谁都有起点；08:00–15:59</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">120分钟；$250；30精力</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">学习战斗反射，仅一次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">武器精通</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">亲密朋友（200）；能力18；完成：谁都有起点；08:00–14:59</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">180分钟；$350；40精力</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">学习武器精通，仅一次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">进阶步法</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">完成：一个不少地回来；08:00–16:59</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">60分钟；20精力</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">基础好感+8；感知 +1；仅一次</td></tr></tbody></table><p>交谈每次给1基础好感、每天5次；巧克力给5基础好感、每天2次。完成“谁都有起点”后，“控制性对练”每天可让能力提高1，并给2基础好感。“一个不少地回来”之后，还要单独领取一次“进阶步法”，获得感知+1及8基础好感；完成事件不会自动领取这份奖励。</p><p>“训练效率”和“队员训练”都是训练厅服务，完成“报到任教”和“谁都有起点”后，于08:00–17:59使用。“队员训练”以2军队经验换取1队员个人经验。“训练效率”按每名已招募英雄分别购买，最高10级，可降低属性训练经验消耗，并退还符合条件的已投入差额。材料费用和完整成长规则见军队指南。</p><p>完成Cid介绍时源矿的事件后，训练厅会开放一次性的“强化武器”：消耗10块时源矿锭，不额外耗时，让近战武器等级永久提高1。这里消耗的是熔炼后的矿锭，不是原矿。</p><p>她偏好的属性为能力、感知、耐力。学会战斗反射可提高关系加成。</p><p>表中均为开始时间，不包含结束整点。基础好感受关系加成影响，直接好感按所列数值增加。谈心与个人自动事件只完成一次；普通好感、玩家情趣经验和NPC亲密经验分别计算。</p></section>
<section id="zh-troubleshooting"><h2>卡住时检查什么</h2><ul><li>没有Anthrax头像：先完成主线74，并在作战中心触发“计划外的教官”。</li><li>她不在诊所了：完成“报到任教”后，改去训练厅。</li><li>晚上找不到日间事件：中段训练事件要在18:00前开始，谈心则从18:00才开放。</li><li>“今晚不上课”需要前两次谈心及“没有指令的夜晚”；只有浪漫感仍不足以开放“选择相伴”。</li><li>“进阶步法”要在“一个不少地回来”后另外选择领取。</li><li>“强化武器”需要Cid的时源矿介绍和10块矿锭，不能重复购买。</li></ul></section>
